      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miika n'ab'oruganda rwa Daani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebi, omu Isirairi hakaba hatarumu mukama, kandi ab'oruganda rwa Daani bakaba nibeeserurra ensi ey'okwikaramu; habwokuba bakaba batakatungire ensi eyabo habwabo, hagati y'Abaisirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'oruganda rwa Daani nubwo baakomeremu abasaija batano ab'amagezi omu bantu ab'oruganda rwabo, baabaiha omurubuga Zoora na Esitaholi, baabatuma batate ensi kandi bagyetegereze. Obu baahikire omunsi ey'ensozi eya Efuraimu, baaraara omuba Miika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu bakaba bakyali omuba Miika, baahurra iraka ery'omusigazi Omuleevi; nukwo kumuhikaho bakamukaguza bati: “Nooha ayakuleesire kunu? Hanu nookoraho ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabagarukamu ati: “Miika nuwe yancweriire amagezi ganu, yampa omulimo, kandi hati ndi nyakatagara we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugambira bati: “Tukwesengeriize otukagulize Ruhanga nukwo tumanye orugendo rwaitu turukwija kugenda, nkooku ruraaba rurungi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara yabagarukamu ati: “Mugende n'obusinge, Ruhanga naija kubalinda omurugendo rwanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija abataano abo, nubwo baimukize baahika Laisi, baarora abantu ab'omunsi egi nkooku baina obusinge, engeso y'Abasidoni nkooku ekaba eri, kandi baculiire bataina ekirukubaburaho, batungire, bali hara n'Abasidoni, bataina muntu noomu ou barukukorrana na uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obu baagarukire hali bagenzi baabu aba Zoora na Estaholi, bagenzi baabu baabakaguza bati: “Mutuleetire makuru ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babagarukamu bati: “Tukagenda twahika Laisi, tukarora abantu nkooku baina obusinge nk'Abasidoni. Mwije tugende tubarwanise; habwokuba ensi tukagirora, nsi y'orwezo. Nimwenda kwikara aho mutaina ekimurukukora? Muleke kwezigaziga, mugende mutaahe ensi eri, mugirye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumuraagenda, nimwija kuhikaho abantu abataina ekibarukwekenga. Ensi ngazi; mazima kwo, Ruhanga agibahaire; eki nikyo ekiikaro ekitarukuburwamu kintu na kimu eky'omunsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija rukaaga ab'oruganda rwa Daani, abaina ebyokurwanisa eby'obulemu nukwo kwimukya Zoora na Estaholi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagenda baateera orukande Kiryasi-yalimu omu Buyudaaya. Okuhika na hati, ekiikaro eki nikyetwa rukande rwa Daani, kiri Bugwaizooba bwa Kiryasi-yalimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubaarugire aho, baayeyongerayo baahika hansi ey'ensozi eya Efuraimu, baataaha omuba Miika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija abataano abakaba bagenzire kutata ensi Laisi nubwo bakagwize bagenzi baabu bati: “Mumanyire omumaju ganu nkooku harumu eky'okujwara kya hakifuba, n'ekisisani ky'okuramibwa? Habweki nu, muteekereze eki muraakora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakubuutuka, baagenda hanju ya Miika, omusigazi Omuleevi nambere yararaaga, baamuramukya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija orukaaga ab'oruganda rwa Daani, abakaba baina ebyokurwanisa eby'obulemu, baayemerra hairembo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abasaija abataano baakwata eky'okujwara kya ha kifuba, ekisisani ky'okuramibwa, n'ekisisani ekyagiibwe, nyakatagara akyayemeriire hairembo hamu n'abasaija bali orukaaga abakaba baina ebyokurwanisa eby'obulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo obubaataahire omunju ya Miika, bamazire kukwata ekisisani ekisarwirwe, bakwasire eky'okujwara hakifuba, ekisisani ky'okuramibwa n'ekisisani ekyagiibwe, nyakatagara yabakaguza ati: “Nimukora ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamucoomera bati: “Otagamba, akanwa kawe kaigale, ija tugende, obe isiitwe kandi nyakatagara waitu. Ekirukukira oburungi nikiha? Kuba nyakatagara weeka ey'omuntu omu rundi kuba nyakatagara ow'ihanga lyona n'oruganda rwona orwa Isirairi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara obuyahuliire eki, yasemererwa muno; nukwo kukwata eky'okujwara kya hakifuba, ekisisani ky'okuramibwa n'ekisisani ekisarwirwe, yagenda ali hagati y'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakubutuka, baagenda beebembiize abaana, ente, n'ebintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubakaba bairra hara muno enju ya Miika, abataahi abakaba bali omumaju agaheerraine neeye, baateera enduuru, baimukya, baakuraatira ab'oruganda rwa Daani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubakaba nibabahondera nibatoka, ab'oruganda rwa Daani baakubuutuka baakaguza Miika bati: “Obaire ki? Habwaki oiziire n'abantu abo boona?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miika yagarukamu ati: “Mutwaire embandwa zange ezinayekoliire, mwatwara nyakatagara, mwagenda, nyowe nsigaize ki? Hati, ninywe muukunkaguza muti: ‘Obaire ki?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'oruganda rwa Daani baamugarukamu bati: “Leka kutwomberra, otatuzaanisa, obu turaakutaho engaro, buli iwe ofiire neeka yawe yoona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo ab'oruganda rwa Daani baagenda; kandi Miika obuyarozire nkooku bakaba nibamukiza amaani, yakubuutuka yagaruka omuka ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'oruganda rwa Daani obubaamazire kutwara nyakatagara n'ebintu Miika ebyakaba akozire, baahika Laisi omunsi ey'abantu abaculeezi kandi abataina ekibarukwekenga, baabaisa empirima, orubuga rwabo baarwokya n'omurro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
