              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'oruganda rwa Daani, ekisisani kiri ekisarwirwe, bakifoora kyabo; Yonasani mutabani wa Gerosomu, mwijukuru wa Musa, n'abatabani be, nubo baabaire banyakatagara ab'oruganda rwa Daani, okuhikya hakiro ekyabantu bomunsi egi, babanyagire. ",
          "type": "text",
